  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0EDU">Remark <span data-tag="0EDU">82.2.2</span>.</a> In Situation <a href="/tag/0EDT" data-tag="0EDT">82.2.1</a> if $X/B$ is good, then $|X|$ is a sober topological space. See Properties of Spaces, Lemma <a href="/tag/06NJ" data-tag="06NJ">66.15.1</a> or Decent Spaces, Proposition <a href="/tag/03K6" data-tag="03K6">68.12.4</a>. We will use this without further mention to choose generic points of irreducible closed subsets of $|X|$. </p>
